@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

title Vision Feature - Architecture Diagram

node "Vision Service Runtime" {
  component "FastAPI Service\n(src/api.py)" as Service

  frame "Capture Subsystem" {
    component "Webcam/IP Stream Capture" as RuntimeCapture
    component "Change Detection" as ChangeDetect
  }

  frame "Perception Subsystem" {
    component "Preprocessing" as RuntimePreprocess
    component "UI Detection" as RuntimeDetect
    component "BBox Refinement" as RuntimeRefine
    component "Element Enrichment" as RuntimeEnrich
    component "Semantic Interpretation" as RuntimeSemantic
  }

  frame "Session Subsystem" {
    component "Session Aggregator" as RuntimeAggregate
    database "Session Artifacts\nvision/data/sessions" as RuntimeStorage
  }
}

cloud "Model/Engine Dependencies" {
  component "YOLO Weights\n(yolov8n.pt / yolov8s.pt)" as YoloWeights
  component "VLM Provider\n(gemini/claude/gpt4v/local)" as VlmProvider
  component "OCR / CV Libraries\n(OpenCV, optional OCR stack)" as OcrCv
}

Service --> RuntimeCapture : start/stop/capture
RuntimeCapture --> ChangeDetect : frame stream
ChangeDetect --> RuntimeStorage : raw frame writes

Service --> RuntimePreprocess : process request
RuntimePreprocess --> RuntimeDetect
RuntimeDetect --> RuntimeRefine
RuntimeRefine --> RuntimeEnrich
RuntimeEnrich --> RuntimeSemantic

RuntimeSemantic --> RuntimeAggregate : frame-level outputs
RuntimeAggregate --> RuntimeStorage : session summary + artifacts
RuntimeStorage --> Service : final JSON result

RuntimeDetect ..> YoloWeights : load/infer
RuntimeSemantic ..> VlmProvider : prompt/response
RuntimePreprocess ..> OcrCv : image ops
RuntimeRefine ..> OcrCv
RuntimeEnrich ..> OcrCv

@enduml